# bun.lock IS committed: bun >= 1.2 writes this text lockfile and every CI job
# installs with --frozen-lockfile, so the lockfile of record has to be in the
# repo. bun.lockb is the pre-1.2 binary lockfile: bun 1.4 never writes it, so
# it stays ignored to keep a stale binary lockfile out of the tree.
